     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hi\r\neveryone, </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">In order to improve the package <b>FIELDimageR</b>, from version\r\n0.1.7 we will change the name of some functions:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-width:initial;border-style:none\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-width:1pt;border-style:solid;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><b>Old name</b><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top:1pt solid windowtext;border-right:1pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1pt solid windowtext;border-left-width:initial;border-left-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><b>New name</b><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-right:1pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1pt solid windowtext;border-left:1pt solid windowtext;border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">polygonShape()</span></blockquote>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">fieldPolygon()</span></blockquote>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-right:1pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1pt solid windowtext;border-left:1pt solid windowtext;border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">indices() </span></blockquote>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">fieldIndex()</span></blockquote>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-right:1pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1pt solid windowtext;border-left:1pt solid windowtext;border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">getInfo()</span></blockquote>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"312\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:233.75pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n  <blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">fieldInfo()</span></blockquote>